      "writtenOn": "2023-09-21T18:50:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Re: Sue, you don\u0027t need that complicated.\n\n * Enable the `CONFIG_PLATFORM_EC_CBI_TRANSFER_EEPROM_FLASH` and use it in this build. The CBI data should be transferred from the EEPROM to the EC flash at its first boot. The `ectool` will return the data from the CBI in the EC flash.\n * At some point when all the devices have their first boot (probably weeks after the first build), disable the `CONFIG_PLATFORM_EC_CBI_TRANSFER_EEPROM_FLASH`, as all devices have done the transfer.\n * In the next build, put the CBI in the EC flash during the factory.",
      "parentUuid": "a4103b50_db316ed0",
